{"schema_version":3,"specification_snapshot":{"path":"specification-snapshot.json","sha256":"ec80103623b1c486cbf863ffbe93ac67a7c2f1fcb301cf5785350b32152511c7"},"primary_issue_source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","obligations":[{"id":"OBL-001","candidate_key":"436b8a2264c10bf22bc84dade5f18a387adceaeec6fe6097b16fe9724e21e444","source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","source_sha256":"bf9e82356dc265726185f6953e3047d0beba6e1d5fadeaa49715580f48dee303","source_line":5,"source_text":"Formalizar e aplicar de forma consistente a sem\u00e2ntica temporal dos lan\u00e7amentos para evitar diverg\u00eancia entre compet\u00eancia/evento, planejamento e efetiva\u00e7\u00e3o de caixa.","flags":["observable"],"disposition":"covered","requirement_ids":["REQ-597"]},{"id":"OBL-002","candidate_key":"9dd31b8a84a37fba8da24b9b37606886876770a378d4add2d1b15d1f13beb4b0","source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","source_sha256":"bf9e82356dc265726185f6953e3047d0beba6e1d5fadeaa49715580f48dee303","source_line":9,"source_text":"`occurredOn`: data do evento econ\u00f4mico/origem do lan\u00e7amento. Para hist\u00f3rico realizado (`posted`/`reconciled`), continua sendo a data de atribui\u00e7\u00e3o dos relat\u00f3rios que hoje usam esse contrato, como `docs/API_REPORTS.md`.","flags":["review-surface"],"disposition":"covered","requirement_ids":["REQ-597"]},{"id":"OBL-003","candidate_key":"e139f6ce6324c352bf2b73df5b2f64e9e8beff74baa37003ca1f43b127429585","source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","source_sha256":"bf9e82356dc265726185f6953e3047d0beba6e1d5fadeaa49715580f48dee303","source_line":10,"source_text":"`plannedOn`: data prevista/de vencimento usada para um compromisso ainda n\u00e3o efetivado. No legado `PayableReceivable`, o mapeamento existente `plannedOn = dueOn` permanece a preced\u00eancia documentada quando a transi\u00e7\u00e3o cria uma `Transaction` planejada.","flags":["negative","temporal-destination","precedence"],"disposition":"covered","requirement_ids":["REQ-597"]},{"id":"OBL-004","candidate_key":"1ba4af47af7e10a53bf50b80ce3667d6717a59c11c94c986279798b671309e1f","source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","source_sha256":"bf9e82356dc265726185f6953e3047d0beba6e1d5fadeaa49715580f48dee303","source_line":11,"source_text":"`effectiveOn`: data em que o movimento passa a produzir efeito de caixa na conta correspondente. Para compromisso ainda n\u00e3o efetivado, deve permanecer ausente quando n\u00e3o houver efeito de caixa ocorrido.","flags":["negative"],"disposition":"covered","requirement_ids":["REQ-597"]},{"id":"OBL-005","candidate_key":"27fadedfd248dec10895e861d4bacad9a3e2caf610cdfd9564009f144b56a6a7","source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","source_sha256":"bf9e82356dc265726185f6953e3047d0beba6e1d5fadeaa49715580f48dee303","source_line":13,"source_text":"Esses campos representam fatos diferentes. Uma transi\u00e7\u00e3o de estado n\u00e3o deve apagar silenciosamente a data prevista nem substituir a data do evento econ\u00f4mico pela data de caixa.","flags":["negative"],"disposition":"covered","requirement_ids":["REQ-597"]},{"id":"OBL-006","candidate_key":"938e3ff3067566e9c43a810a85f24b12253d14db4fadf38e7e129e8268728bcb","source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","source_sha256":"bf9e82356dc265726185f6953e3047d0beba6e1d5fadeaa49715580f48dee303","source_line":17,"source_text":"**Extrato operacional:** preservar a preced\u00eancia j\u00e1 documentada em `docs/TRANSACTIONS.md`: `effectiveOn` \u2192 `plannedOn` \u2192 `occurredOn` para ordenar, filtrar e calcular a vis\u00e3o operacional da conta.","flags":["temporal-destination","precedence"],"disposition":"covered","requirement_ids":["REQ-597"]},{"id":"OBL-007","candidate_key":"a224c054a999b0bb443f8ab66c7bbddde8faa50496e8fc473861c54c2dc9fe75","source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","source_sha256":"bf9e82356dc265726185f6953e3047d0beba6e1d5fadeaa49715580f48dee303","source_line":18,"source_text":"**Relat\u00f3rios de realizado:** preservar `occurredOn` como data de per\u00edodo para receitas/despesas `posted`/`reconciled` enquanto o documento dono do relat\u00f3rio n\u00e3o definir explicitamente outro contrato.","flags":["negative","temporal","temporal-destination"],"disposition":"covered","requirement_ids":["REQ-597"]},{"id":"OBL-008","candidate_key":"ddaeff5c171e2d5a8b967121f1e6b32fbef6a28d333fdf924ebac5d54e4bf98f","source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","source_sha256":"bf9e82356dc265726185f6953e3047d0beba6e1d5fadeaa49715580f48dee303","source_line":19,"source_text":"**Compromissos futuros/proje\u00e7\u00f5es:** usar `plannedOn` para o evento ainda n\u00e3o efetivado; depois da efetiva\u00e7\u00e3o, a ocorr\u00eancia n\u00e3o pode permanecer simultaneamente como compromisso futuro e movimento realizado.","flags":["negative","temporal","temporal-destination"],"disposition":"covered","requirement_ids":["REQ-597"]},{"id":"OBL-009","candidate_key":"06fac5bee74bbd86eaa492a75f7954384cc44050fea6af2ec21d06738b9c172c","source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","source_sha256":"bf9e82356dc265726185f6953e3047d0beba6e1d5fadeaa49715580f48dee303","source_line":20,"source_text":"**Compatibilidade legada:** fallback existe para leitura/transi\u00e7\u00e3o de dados antigos, mas n\u00e3o deve criar uma segunda fonte de sem\u00e2ntica temporal para novos registros.","flags":["negative","forbidden-implementation"],"disposition":"covered","requirement_ids":["REQ-597"]},{"id":"OBL-010","candidate_key":"7adf73e2180c858b50368e0ef6ac1878d9315840a8e077e7a8c9daf1345045f6","source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","source_sha256":"bf9e82356dc265726185f6953e3047d0beba6e1d5fadeaa49715580f48dee303","source_line":24,"source_text":"aplicar as defini\u00e7\u00f5es acima em cria\u00e7\u00e3o manual, recorr\u00eancias, parcelas, importa\u00e7\u00f5es, concilia\u00e7\u00e3o, compras de cart\u00e3o e liquida\u00e7\u00f5es;","flags":[],"disposition":"covered","requirement_ids":["REQ-597"]},{"id":"OBL-011","candidate_key":"090b7c2fdce1be6cd633233ab0843ecba0c2deb86a36bb3e541d19a910a7023f","source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","source_sha256":"bf9e82356dc265726185f6953e3047d0beba6e1d5fadeaa49715580f48dee303","source_line":28,"source_text":"adicionar valida\u00e7\u00f5es de dom\u00ednio/API quando combina\u00e7\u00f5es forem inv\u00e1lidas;","flags":[],"disposition":"covered","requirement_ids":["REQ-597"]},{"id":"OBL-012","candidate_key":"9feeae1fcf28b32c5561373b20b16f2240b919082c86c3f46fb0c51ff70c0cb2","source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","source_sha256":"bf9e82356dc265726185f6953e3047d0beba6e1d5fadeaa49715580f48dee303","source_line":29,"source_text":"preservar hist\u00f3rico temporal necess\u00e1rio na transi\u00e7\u00e3o `planned` \u2192 `posted`/`reconciled`.","flags":["review-surface"],"disposition":"covered","requirement_ids":["REQ-597"]},{"id":"OBL-013","candidate_key":"de75d8e767a0a74194fd711029192b1396de08128e271f9ec5dd40b8bc955271","source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","source_sha256":"bf9e82356dc265726185f6953e3047d0beba6e1d5fadeaa49715580f48dee303","source_line":33,"source_text":"**must_be_single_source:** cada uso (Extrato operacional, realizado hist\u00f3rico, compromisso futuro) deve ter uma preced\u00eancia temporal documentada; renderers ou relat\u00f3rios n\u00e3o podem inventar outra ordem local.","flags":["exhaustive","negative","temporal","temporal-destination","review-surface","precedence"],"disposition":"covered","requirement_ids":["REQ-597"]},{"id":"OBL-014","candidate_key":"d0d13a754b3a15e6bc6c535436866de524e0c6edcfaa5e221417ce02624ca325","source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","source_sha256":"bf9e82356dc265726185f6953e3047d0beba6e1d5fadeaa49715580f48dee303","source_line":35,"source_text":"**must_not_behave:** efetivar/concilidar um compromisso n\u00e3o pode sobrescrever a data prevista de forma que o sistema perca a diferen\u00e7a entre previsto e realizado.","flags":["negative"],"disposition":"covered","requirement_ids":["REQ-597"]},{"id":"OBL-015","candidate_key":"31127861ec813c02b446456b79af088321b825eb8cf73d2f277c42490411f333","source_id":"SRC-ISSUE-597","source_sha256":"bf9e82356dc265726185f6953e3047d0beba6e1d5fadeaa49715580f48dee303","source_line":36,"source_text":"**forbidden_implementation:** n\u00e3o usar um \u0